<div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Emerging growth company&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d20268K" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany" id="ixv-516">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></div>

